•	Value Lengths: Analyze text length distributions
•	Value Counts: Count frequency of unique values
•	Bar Graph: Create bar charts
•	Boxplot: Generate aggregated data box plots
•	Unique Values: Identify distinct values
•	Describe: Generate statistical summaries
•	Pivot Table: Create summary tables
