Workflow Guidance
Getting Started
1.	Click Import Data to load your dataset
2.	Use Quick Scan to understand your data structure
3.	Explore Data Analysis tab for basic operations
Common Tasks
Cleaning Data:
1.	Use Remove Null Values to clean missing data
2.	Apply Remove Duplicates to eliminate repeats
3.	Use Standardize Names to clean text columns
Analyzing Data:
1.	Try Describe for statistical overview
2.	Use Correlation Matrix to find relationships
3.	Apply Group By and Sum for categorical summaries
Visualizing Data:
1.	Select Bar Graph or Box Plot from Data Analysis tab
2.	Choose the column to visualize
3.	Customize as needed
Advanced Analysis:
1.	Explore Advanced Features tab for machine learning
2.	Use Auto Insights for automated discovery
3.	Try Pattern Finder for hidden trends
Tips for Effective Use
1.	Start Simple: Begin with basic operations before advanced features
2.	Use Undo/Redo: Experiment freely with undo support
3.	Save Frequently: Export important results
4.	Check Data Quality: Use Health Check before analysis
5.	Explore Example Data: Learn features with provided samples
Support & Learning
•	Use Example Data to practice
•	Each button has tooltips explaining its function
•	Complex operations provide guided dialogs
•	Error messages suggest corrective actions

